    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\left(x+\\frac72\\right)^2+\\frac34$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2+7x+13&=\\left(x+\\frac72\\right)^2-\\frac{49}{4}+13\\\\x^2+7x+13&=\\left(x+\\frac72\\right)^2+\\frac34.\\end{align*}$$",
